<title>USA: General American Investors full results.</title>
<headline>General American Investors full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>GENERAL AMERICAN INVESTORS COMPANY INC.</p>
<p>				  AS OF OR FOR THE YEAR ENDED DEC. 31</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net assets			  $597,596,693	$573,693,425</p>
<p> Net assets per common share	 25.24(a)		 23.94</p>
<p> Net investment income		5,189,266	   1,961,039</p>
<p>Investment income</p>
<p>  per share				     .22		   .08</p>
<p> Net investment gain (loss)	88,543,807	 106,846,680</p>
<p>Net investment gain (loss</p>
<p>  per share)				   3.86		  4.54</p>
