<p>Dec. 31 (a) After capital gain distributions of $2.27 per share paid in December 1996 and $.31 per share paid in February 1996 and after income dividends of 19 cents per share paid in December 1996 and 1 cent per share paid in February 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
